{"title":"여보, 나 파업할게요 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dxuNUJ/dJMcaiFaQlH/sSs0dBVPloQqVHnF20Zik0&filename=th3","synopsis":"2회차 결혼 생활, 돌연 파업 선언?!결혼 생활 10년 동안무뚝뚝하고 전쟁밖에 모르던 남편 제스터 옆에서고생만 하다 불치병으로 죽은 카시아.하지만 눈을 떠보니 10년 전결혼 후 첫 날로 돌아와 있었다.어차피 불치병으로 죽을 몸,카시아는 이번 생엔 아무것도 안 하고 놀고 먹겠다며'파업'을 선언하는데...하지만 이번 생의 제스터는카시아에게 조심스레 마음을 표현하며그녀의 사랑을 얻기 위해 최선을 다한다.남편의 변화가 이상하면서도 싫지만은 않았던 카시아, 이번 생은 과연 행복한 결혼 생활을 맞이할 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":297,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":208,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":80}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":16,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":1,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":2,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":3,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":5,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":15,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":10,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":20,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-10-19","rank":31,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-10-20","rank":41,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-10-21","rank":38,"chang